<title>UK: Air cargo at BAA UK airports rises 6.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Air cargo at BAA UK airports rises 6.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo tonnage handled at BAA's seven British airports in February was 6.2 percent above the figure for the same 1996 month, BAA data shows.</p>
